  "historyNote": "#5072, eff 2-21-91, EXPIRED 2-21-97 New. #6476, eff 3-26-97; ss and moved by #8306, eff 3-22-05 (from Rev 1101.13); ss by #10304, eff 3-22-13; ss by #13503, eff 12-9-22",
